   Welcome, my friend, to the land of dungeons.
I am the Dungeon Keeper, and even as we speak,
my faithful Orcs are preparing a special level 3 dungeon
just for you!
 
   There I have placed many powerful weapons to aid you
and some rather unusual beasts, to make your stay...
more interesting! Ha, ha, ha!
 
You are a centaur - half man, half horse.
Your goal is to search the dungeon,
find the great Power Ring, and return ... alive!
 
In front of you stands the entrance to the mystical dungeon.
Do you dare to enter? Not on your life!
 
That's too bad.  Maybe some milder game would suit you better.
A rousing game of Old Maid, perhaps?
 
Would you like to play again? No way!
Well, please come again.
 
